            <description><![CDATA[<h4>Added</h4>
<ul>
<li>Link Report Copy Image copies a PNG of the entire sorted report, including</li>
</ul>
<p>  column headers and all rows, with wrapped URLs and notes.</p>
<h4>Changed</h4>
<ul>
<li>The onboarding Watch Folders step now points out the menu bar paper-plane</li>
</ul>
<p>  icon and explains how it shows status, controls folders, and reopens the app.</p>
<ul>
<li>Help Center Watch Folders guidance now documents the menu bar controls and</li>
</ul>
<p>  clarifies that closing the main window leaves Jetstream running.</p>]]></description>
